+		<English>The [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Colossus[COLOR_REVERT] adds extra commerce to all water tiles in your coastal cities. It also increases its city's odds of generating a [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Great Merchant[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] lets this wonder go obsolete with Chemistry instead of [LINK=TECH_ASTRONOMY]Astronomy[\LINK] because Astronomy now obsoletes the [LINK=BUILDING_GREAT_LIGHTHOUSE}Great Lighthouse[\LINK]. K-Mod has increased the [ICON_PRODUCTION] cost of the Colossus.</English>
